%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d7e76c79f1aa7df4391b0909e0ea0543, type: 3}
  m_Name: chef
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: AssassinMystery::AssassinMystery.SuspectData
  id: chef
  displayName: Bertrand Moule
  role: Royal Chef
  profile: Rules the kitchens and the stores beneath them. Loud, proud and protective
    of his wine.
  coatColor: {r: 0.9019608, g: 0.8745098, b: 0.8156863, a: 1}
  accentColor: {r: 0.54509807, g: 0.3529412, b: 0.16862746, a: 1}
  skinColor: {r: 0.8901961, g: 0.70980394, b: 0.5882353, a: 1}
  headwear: 4
  heightScale: 0.95
  beard: 0
  greeting: Out of my way! The feast is in minutes and the sauce will not reduce
    itself!
  topics:
  - question: What will the Queen eat and drink tonight?
    response: Seven courses, every one tasted by my own boy. But the toast is not
      mine. Her Majesty drinks only from her private cask of Aldmere Red. Nobody
      pours that but by order.
    recordInNotebook: 1
    requiresClue: {fileID: 0}
    revealsClue: {fileID: 0}
  - question: Who ordered the Queen's cask brought up?
    response: 'An order slip came down this afternoon. Very official, very fussy:
      the Queen''s cask, poured alone. I left it on my pantry shelf.'
    recordInNotebook: 1
    requiresClue: {fileID: 0}
    revealsClue: {fileID: 0}
  - question: Where were you this afternoon?
    response: Here! In the kitchen and the stores all day. Ask anyone. Ask the pots.
    recordInNotebook: 1
    requiresClue: {fileID: 0}
    revealsClue: {fileID: 0}
  - question: Someone has been selling castle wine.
    response: Ah. Ahem. A few spare bottles to a merchant in town. Spare! Nobody
      misses them. That is not murder, detective. That is... business.
    recordInNotebook: 1
    requiresClue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ad2be158e1f57bf4f9fd44791f8b2e7c, type: 2}
    revealsClue: {fileID: 0}
  - question: The Queen's cask was opened and resealed today.
    response: Resealed? Nobody touches that cask but me, and I have not opened it
      since the harvest. If the wax is fresh, someone else has been down here.
    recordInNotebook: 1
    requiresClue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41d15aa1e21ec544cb7deded1d2fe4a8, type: 2}
    revealsClue: {fileID: 0}
  - question: The toast order is in green ink.
    response: Green, black, purple, what do I care? It had the Treasury seal. When
      the Treasury says jump, the kitchen jumps.
    recordInNotebook: 1
    requiresClue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1e48c9b3bb5c2524aa0e9d9a071439f2, type: 2}
    revealsClue: {fileID: 0}
